    {"qid":13,"solutionSha256":"b4c60d01f9f8b02f14e32b1bdee4e71c8afe4654b079e7e1406c902288a38a3e","review":"The left side is 0 when sin(theta)>=0 and -2sin(theta) otherwise; the right side is 0 when cos(theta)>=0 and -2cos(theta) otherwise. This yields the first-quadrant interval plus theta=5pi/4 only, then the stated B interval and union. No further correction is needed."},
    {"qid":21,"solutionSha256":"e2b2a56edfeeb0a82c517d5e25457bb4ab1a42837131979674ffe372cbbdd5d9","review":"The shoelace sum is p-1+p+(5-p)^2-p^2=24-8p; halving its absolute value gives |12-4p|. Area 8 gives p=1 or 5, and the first-quadrant condition excludes 5. A=(1,4), a=4 and AB=3sqrt(2). No further correction is needed."}
